flowchart LR
  U[High-level public report] --> G[Auth, rate, size, and schema gate]
  G --> Q[(Quarantine store)]
  Q --> H[Authenticated human reviewer]
  H -->|needs evidence, reject, duplicate| Q
  H -->|accepted private| A[(Private accepted record)]
  A -->|separate publication decision| P[Minimized publication record]
  P --> F[JSON and NDJSON feed]
  Q -. raw reports never enter .-> F
